---
---

<section class="w-full overflow-hidden hero-alternative">

  <div class="w-full bg-[var(--color-navbar-bg)] py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-32 px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 relative">
    
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-8 items-center relative z-10">

      <div class="flex flex-col space-y-8">

        <h1 class="text-[4.5rem] sm:text-[6rem] md:text-[7.5rem] lg:text-[9rem] leading-[0.85] tracking-normal text-gray-900" style="font-family: var(--ff-heading);">
          <span class="font-extrabold text-[1.2em]">Somos</span><br />
          <span class="font-light text-[var(--color-brand-sky-blue)]">Fintegrar</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-alt-lead max-w-xl mt-4">
          Somos el aliado que le acompaña a crecer: créditos ágiles, convenios exclusivos y beneficios pensados para usted y su familia.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative w-full h-[500px] lg:h-[700px] flex justify-center items-center">
         
         <div class="absolute right-0 lg:right-10 w-[85%] sm:w-[320px] lg:w-[380px] h-[90%] lg:h-[600px] bg-[var(--color-brand-purple)] rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
            <img src="/assets/img/orbit-familia.webp" alt="Familia asociada disfrutando de los servicios digitales de Fintegrar" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
         </div>

         <div class="absolute left-0 md:left-[10%] lg:left-[5%] top-[25%] flex flex-col gap-3 z-20">
            <div class="hero-float-card hero-float-card-1 bg-[var(--color-brand-sky-blue)] rounded-full px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-3 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(var(--color-black-rgb),0.15)]">
               <div class="bg-white text-[var(--color-brand-sky-blue)] rounded-full w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</div>
               <span class="text-sm font-bold text-white">¿Necesita un crédito rápido?</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-float-card hero-float-card-2 bg-[var(--color-brand-sky-blue)] rounded-full px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-3 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(var(--color-black-rgb),0.15)] ml-4 sm:-ml-6">
               <div class="bg-white text-[var(--color-brand-sky-blue)] rounded-full w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</div>
               <span class="text-sm font-bold text-white">¿Ya conoce nuestros convenios?</span>
            </div>
         </div>

         <div class="hero-float-card hero-float-card-3 absolute top-10 right-0 lg:-right-10 bg-[var(--color-brand-sky-blue)] rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(var(--color-black-rgb),0.15)] w-[210px] z-20">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-2">Tasa desde</p>
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-1 whitespace-nowrap">1.53% <span class="text-sm font-normal">M.V.</span></h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-white/90 leading-tight">Crédito Ordinario</p>
         </div>

         <div class="hero-float-card hero-float-card-4 absolute bottom-10 -right-4 md:right-0 lg:right-[-2rem] bg-[var(--color-brand-sky-blue)] rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(var(--color-black-rgb),0.15)] w-[210px] z-20">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-2">Crédito Educativo</p>
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-1 whitespace-nowrap">1% <span class="text-sm font-normal">M.V.</span></h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-white/90 leading-tight">Tasas preferenciales con aliados certificados</p>
         </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<style>
  .hero-alternative {
    padding: 0;
  }

  @keyframes heroFloatIn {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(18px) scale(0.96);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    }
  }

  @keyframes heroFloatLoop {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
  }

  .hero-float-card {
    opacity: 0;
    animation: heroFloatIn 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards,
      heroFloatLoop 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    animation-delay: var(--float-delay, 0s), calc(var(--float-delay, 0s) + 0.7s);
  }

  .hero-float-card-1 { --float-delay: 0.1s; }
  .hero-float-card-2 { --float-delay: 0.3s; }
  .hero-float-card-3 { --float-delay: 0.5s; }
  .hero-float-card-4 { --float-delay: 0.7s; }

  .hero-alt-lead {
    font-family: var(--ff-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.125rem);
    line-height: var(--lh-160);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
